('single-dumbbell-skullcrusher','Single Dumbbell Skullcrusher','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('dumbbell-overhead-tricep-extension','Dumbbell Overhead Tricep Extension','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('single-arm-dumbbell-tricep-extension','Single Arm Dumbbell Tricep Extension','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('bench-dip','Bench Dip','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,'Sit on the edge of a bench or chair with your hands gripping the edge next to your hips. Slide your butt off the bench and straighten your legs in front of you, keeping your heels on the ground. Bend your elbows and lower your body towards the ground, keeping your back close to the bench. Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push yourself back up to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.','["Sit on the edge of a bench or chair with your hands gripping the edge next to your hips.","Slide your butt off the bench and straighten your legs in front of you, keeping your heels on the ground.","Bend your elbows and lower your body towards the ground, keeping your back close to the bench.","Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push yourself back up to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
('tricep-kickback','Tricep Kickback','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,'["Start with a dumbbell in each hand and your palms facing your torso. Keep your back straight with a slight bend in the knees and bend forward at the waist. Your torso should be almost parallel to the floor. Make sure to keep your head up. Your upper arms should be close to your torso and parallel to the floor. Your forearms should be pointed towards the floor as you hold the weights. There should be a 90-degree angle formed between your forearm and upper arm. This is your starting position.","Now, while keeping your upper arms stationary, exhale and use your triceps to lift the weights until the arm is fully extended. Focus on moving the forearm.","After a brief pause at the top contraction, inhale and slowly lower the dumbbells back down to the starting position.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
('wrist-extension','Wrist Extension','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('farmer-carry','Farmer Carry','dumbbell','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('crunch','Crunch','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,'Lie flat on your back with your knees bent and feet flat on the ground. Extend your arms straight above your head. Engaging your abs, lift your upper body off the ground, curling forward towards your knees. Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your upper body back down to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.','["Lie flat on your back with your knees bent and feet flat on the ground.","Extend your arms straight above your head.","Engaging your abs, lift your upper body off the ground, curling forward towards your knees.","Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your upper body back down to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000);
