('banded-squat','Banded Squat','other','compound',0,0,NULL,180,0,'Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, with the band placed just above your knees. Keeping your chest up and core engaged, push your hips back and bend your knees to lower into a squat position. Make sure your knees are tracking over your toes and your weight is in your heels. Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push through your heels to return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.','["Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, with the band placed just above your knees.","Keeping your chest up and core engaged, push your hips back and bend your knees to lower into a squat position.","Make sure your knees are tracking over your toes and your weight is in your heels.","Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push through your heels to return to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
