('toe-touch','Toe Touch','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,'Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and your arms extended out to the sides. Bend forward at the waist, keeping your back straight and your knees slightly bent. Reach down towards your toes with both hands, keeping your legs straight. Pause for a moment at the bottom, then slowly return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.','["Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and your arms extended out to the sides.","Bend forward at the waist, keeping your back straight and your knees slightly bent.","Reach down towards your toes with both hands, keeping your legs straight.","Pause for a moment at the bottom, then slowly return to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
('heel-tap','Heel Tap','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
