('bear-plank','Bear Plank','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('bear-crawl','Bear Crawl','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,'Start on all fours with your hands directly under your shoulders and your knees directly under your hips. Lift your knees slightly off the ground, keeping your back flat and your core engaged. Move your right hand and left foot forward simultaneously, followed by your left hand and right foot. Continue crawling forward, alternating your hand and foot movements. Maintain a steady pace and keep your core tight throughout the exercise. Continue for the desired distance or time.','["Start on all fours with your hands directly under your shoulders and your knees directly under your hips.","Lift your knees slightly off the ground, keeping your back flat and your core engaged.","Move your right hand and left foot forward simultaneously, followed by your left hand and right foot.","Continue crawling forward, alternating your hand and foot movements.","Maintain a steady pace and keep your core tight throughout the exercise.","Continue for the desired distance or time."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
('crab-walk','Crab Walk','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
('inchworm','Inchworm','bodyweight','compound',0,0,NULL,180,0,'Start in a standing position with your feet hip-width apart. Bend forward at the waist and place your hands on the ground in front of you. Walk your hands forward until you are in a high plank position, with your body in a straight line from head to toe. Pause for a moment, then walk your hands back towards your feet, keeping your legs as straight as possible. Once your hands reach your feet, stand back up to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.','["Start in a standing position with your feet hip-width apart.","Bend forward at the waist and place your hands on the ground in front of you.","Walk your hands forward until you are in a high plank position, with your body in a straight line from head to toe.","Pause for a moment, then walk your hands back towards your feet, keeping your legs as straight as possible.","Once your hands reach your feet, stand back up to the starting position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."]',1788745400000,1788745400000),
('l-sit-hold','L-Sit Hold','bodyweight','isolation',0,0,NULL,90,0,NULL,NULL,1788745400000,1788745400000),
